{"id":"wx2652876272","title":"聚焦，热议！","published_at":"2026-03-06T12:13:00+08:00","published_label":"2026-03-06","cover":"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/dVw6Fiav4ckDsfp4KWOniapgiaNbbPGYwRXia03goYmaOJuTgsAWibGKiaddjkrib8fXLUHYo0LbrHlrvhoBZ7ew9d0GffN04oUwgQWk3D5G0iaEcvc/0?wx_fmt=jpeg","summary":"3月4日-5日 备受瞩目的2026全国两会在北京开幕 全国人大代表 华农动物科学学院院长谢青梅 全国政协委员 华农副校长温小波 赴京参会 全校师生通过多种渠道 收听收看大会盛况 第一时间学习领会两会精神 3月5日上午，第十四届全国人民代表大…","tags":["人物","活动"],"source":"wechat","original_url":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=MjM5OTE2MzUwNA==&mid=2652876272&idx=1&sn=330bd7d640f3c870c15180f09b646f14","paper_url":null,"word_count":2405,"fetched_at":"2026-11-09T16:34:54+08:00","content_html":"<div><section><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/w4bIWyNFlcib9OUORJLexR67iaNiaHMVsUPnrMCxOs4d75byZVqb9icp60drwxLtIDbs1v6NLBtGH2FfIrVwwNyQmw/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section><p><span><span>3月4日-5日</span></span></p><p><span><span>备受瞩目的2026全国两会在北京开幕</span></span></p><p><span><span>全国人大代表</span></span></p><p><span><span>华农动物科学学院院长谢青梅</span></span></p><p><span><span>全国政协委员</span></span></p><p><span><span>华农副校长温小波</span></span></p><p><span><span>赴京参会</span></span></p><p><span><span>全校师生通过多种渠道</span></span></p><p><span><span>收听收看大会盛况</span></span></p><p><span><span>第一时间学习领会两会精神</span></span></p><p><span><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/dVw6Fiav4ckBIbDtylGRcPywbobzqMNb9oFNfZ4TzQwMhZ5mlsEdvITTibUlpicxbdkzncEuTQzNWJXG5DglrIVtTicia6QnFl6Ie2n0l5k1yF3E/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;from=appmsg\"/></span></p><p><span><span>3月5日上午，第十四届全国人民代表大会第四次会议在北京人民大会堂开幕</span></span></p><section><a href=\"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=MzA4NDI3NjcyNA==&amp;mid=2650202057&amp;idx=1&amp;sn=0fe2761a650387222abbf64c409f1295&amp;scene=21#wechat_redirect\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><span><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/dVw6Fiav4ckCtfl1X046MTHNjZiahuGPITQydmRYnv4MINIfD77DvwSqxxdS09RDgicRzb0Z05ahbbJTgiavUjHiaTP0ZjQFiczIagMBjlvQpt1lQ/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></span></a></section><p><span><span>点击图片速览</span></span><span><span>2026年政府工作报告</span></span></p><p><span><span>师生们纷纷表示</span></span></p><p><span><span>要凝心聚力、振奋精神</span></span></p><p><span><span>将会议精神转化为推动学校</span></span></p><p><span><span>高质量发展的实际行动</span></span></p><p><span><span>立德树人、强农兴农</span></span></p><p><span><span>在服务国家战略和区域发展中</span></span></p><p><span><span>展现华农担当</span></span></p><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>校党委书记 李凤亮 </span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/dVw6Fiav4ckDmUryapcwED72aZJcAxJQl7Pxz3JtwqIyQa4JoPbKib1zwrFMm8YlqCwhQRicsZ0JSViaOdnsT3Lj0JkSRcr66AB6z7rRFXy1qrY/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section><section><section><section><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/dVw6Fiav4ckA6g9aTz1cCSiaMCzxNRQG6SbAvtzacWR7tJ1WO7gymibyibwQW3wt79o2AIbfDXwAko19j7BxyR8HquVj7ibibvCeOAiaZ9X0Zk0Bbw/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section><section><section><section><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/dVw6Fiav4ckCddCb5eicqeZvx7LuAG0CvVGJcSUJs9ic2PbJx95TqebGjpXaRibcElicmcibL8dicoXNbAwjBicxGMtHIKGokKArwaaXb3YrcFDMo0I/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span><span>全国两会胜利召开，恰逢“十五五”开局关键节点，举国关注、举世瞩目，社会各界满怀期待，共同迎接这场“春天的盛会”。全国两会聚焦高质量发展、科技创新、乡村振兴、民生保障等核心议题，紧扣时代脉搏、贴合群众心愿，既彰显了国家发展的坚定决心，也传递出温暖厚重的民生温度。</span></span></p><p><span><span>华南农业大学作为粤港澳大湾区唯一的农业特色综合性“双一流”高校，将深刻把握全球发展趋势、国家重大战略和区域发展需求、教育变革发展形势和产业发展机遇，立足特色优势，走好内涵发展、改革创新、开放合作、科学治理、文化引领之路，优化学科专业布局，深化体制机制改革，一体推进教育科技人才协同发展，助力农业科技创新与未来产业体系融合，努力当好华南地区农业高等教育的排头兵，奋力谱写农业特色世界一流大学建设的新篇章。</span></span></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>校党委副书记、校长 薛红卫 </span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/dVw6Fiav4ckBDuh8MKD0osic9vRSkAKuuibTMrUtPnAqFg0oNn3iaMoBLL4zIpiaicYviaFXoicDLWeJsY619AqoPbqsnApluGshhN9LQx5HdibdKicVQ/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section><section><section><section><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/dVw6Fiav4ckAKkpuQe3gv8liakb2YvfkbJeW8v4GdTkKibKHtmLaxbPUkvUxmINtRmBsb3piaqbGwTPiaA6LteKQHicwYY9UPGPXcW4uico259ubb4/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section><section><section><section><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/dVw6Fiav4ckDwMv0J21MjUwMZ6QFCQqk5TmfibQ8licpa4Q4uicrXWuXscA5aWFf9ibH0zOl472v5g33ONibrC8N9flQvMGBkTe5NFj7NSSZCwRiaE/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span><span>全国两会的胜利召开，意义重大、催人奋进，华农全校上下高度关注、反响</span></span><span><span>热烈</span></span><span><span>。政府工作报告中提到的“一体推进教育科技人才发展”“推动科技创新和产业创新深度融合”“加快农业农村现代化”等方面内容，都与华农息息相关，为学校做好下一阶段工作提供了明确指引。</span></span></p><p><span><span>站在新征程的起点，华农将锚定农业特色世界一流大学目标，胸怀全局、登高望远，抓住新一轮科技革命和产业变革历史机遇，主动融入教育强国、农业强国和科技强国建设大局，前瞻布局未来学科发展，攻坚前沿关键核心技术，推动人才链、创新链和产业链深度融合，在践行“跨出农兴农”“综合性+国际化”“学科交叉融合”的新赛道中实现赶超跨越、突围领先，推动华农建设成为支撑强国建设和区域发展的核心创新引擎和卓越战略力量。</span></span></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>全国人大代表</span></strong></p><p><strong><span>动物科学学院院长、教授 谢青梅</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/dVw6Fiav4ckDcNWFxt2aNOGSu7E1qtDcQ1WoVYal9ibqBu5aoWOSmTXzzeJn50dUKf32LicWNktVbEBBYvhRHicTgicMXIyACta2k716vkibGY8ww/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section><section><section><section><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/dVw6Fiav4ckAicsn1RElMmBfWxP5jxfv7DeHBjVnVwZcw2OMYcicsbCUmHfR1avM193b4jP2ubtDIlRdDibibvSn1ph8gz2NXdeSEgdLtq0kPgg0/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section><section><section><section><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/dVw6Fiav4ckC2xwGhCal96m6R68hNkK3TGxJcTPf00DBwnZjSVEVnxawFFutJz7kVVwmCFB86YJnKialfKIowPrnd7zdicjEwgzEZqvFKjPGF4/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span><span>作为全国人大代表，我带着农业科教工作者的使命与基层群众的期盼赴京参加全国两会，深感责任重大、使命光荣。在现场听完政府工作报告，我深深为国家的发展进步感到自豪，同时也时刻关注着农业教育科技的未来方向。深耕畜禽育种科研和产业一线多年，我深知，唯有将创新链、人才链、产业链打通融合，才能真正实现科技赋能、推动产业发展。</span></span></p><p><span><span>今年是“十五五”开局之年，我聚焦农业人才培养、畜禽行业发展、科研平台建设等领域带来多份建议，用行动践行“人民选我当代表，我当代表为人民”的承诺。我将继续发挥专业特长、提高履职能力，以实干实绩赋能学校“双一流”建设和乡村振兴，为助力广东走在前、作示范、挑大梁作出更大贡献。</span></span></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>广东省劳动模范</span></strong></p><p><strong><span>农学院院长、教授 储成才 </span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/dVw6Fiav4ckAXablAgsnibyo8PbFGDWdsPXXO1j9HrIUOafdnqvmS6PNFas4X7jBicEjWpycroaHsT7y5Gt6fLoVTcmnjIt679pLaA8HuQ3YU8/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section><section><section><section><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/dVw6Fiav4ckCScjShcbvvcBBgk8OPUkjZ0hNEUPVIxpZ3NmmDVKZictVAfvHsMKF1d0upo02CsbuC7aduHK2Qy8CeehTb4kaAphE8vrhVLXug/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section><section><section><section><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/dVw6Fiav4ckAlFeaibH4GPibIG9Hicmhpo4b4A1cjm5ib9h2qbsSXrYM2LE17ibu5aVDkltHfjA70cEEkrBFtUp1qvWg9x1tNVkmicibn5QHiaqSn5qg/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span><span>2026年全国两会胜利召开，政府工作报告为教育工作划了不少重点，如“加快高水平科技自立自强”部分提到，要分类推进高校改革，动态调整学科专业，启动新一轮“双一流”建设，建设国家交叉学科中心，加大拔尖创新人才自主培养力度等内容，在全院师生干部中引发热议。</span></span></p><p><span><span>农学院将紧扣国家和区域发展战略需求，立足“作物学”一流学科建设，努力产出更多高水平原创性成果，助力学校优化“农科更强”学科布局，强化基础与交叉学科建设，深化产教融合，提升服务乡村振兴和高质量发展的能力和水平。我们将把全国两会精神融入教学科研，培养更多适配新质生产力的高素质复合型人才，引领同学们夯实专业根基、投身科研和产业一线，以实际行动为强国建设注入青春动能。</span></span></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span> 广东省第七届高校（本科）</span></strong></p><p><strong><span>青年教师教学大赛思政专项</span></strong></p><p><strong><span>一等奖获得者</span></strong></p><p><strong><span>马克思主义学院副教授 缪燚晶 </span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/dVw6Fiav4ckAjxWJEqa3xJOB5WAs6eGzfwFx97t3UlscPKAsuu6icVUiaUW698pHUCNIc13KQaO4XHsDCDZqHXhUqE2XPOm6AF4ibWg06NeQjgA/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section><section><section><section><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/dVw6Fiav4ckD9NzW96Sq53hLml8dIeLDMDW6d5OC0JoQXlVxx4rnGz6gCRmoJ0DibnQtEpZFuAT4iaxXekcnKvhPkZbFeHhq1ZbEAdzGL4EJGo/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section><section><section><section><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/dVw6Fiav4ckDcG4GCjvHAbT2JqshaNOR4ln2J7X3wKI7Ef9QEca0icuZRCkIIFFUboiaFibBxL4ksP4XNmakDsIStBjzD5p5EgzQzM55uRyeNQc/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span><span>作为华南农业大学思政课教师，我密切关注2026年全国两会教育热点，深受鼓舞、倍感振奋。“十五五”规划与教育强国建设纲要擘画发展蓝图，政府工作报告聚焦基础教育提质、增加普通高中学位、扩大优质本科招生等民生实事，彰显公平与质量并重的导向。过去一年，学前教育普惠、县中振兴、专业优化等举措成效显著。</span></span></p><p><span><span>立足粤港澳大湾区农业高校定位，我对教育强国、农业强国建设充满信心。今后，我将坚守思政课堂主阵地，把两会精神融入教学，紧扣国家战略与广东乡村振兴、“百千万工程”实践，厚植学生知农爱农、强农兴农情怀，引导青年扎根南粤、服务基层，以立德树人实效为教育强国建设贡献华农思政力量。</span></span></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>人工智能与低空技术学院</span></strong></p><p><strong><span>2023级博士生 秦英栋 </span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/dVw6Fiav4ckAGtBj7w2YkA5qIA9b0bWr0cvxRXsKM9Gy1oHQbOsicHoAmeLayKQEZYUVVexhibf3vOcHFI6H7E10pG3evaKu5XQP61E42JHFibU/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section><section><section><section><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/dVw6Fiav4ckCH25Qkj0GFuhQiaS7y3ic4cAq86yz6v8FXouggV2wu6JEMKLJSp8PQIkExYsM5omK3gWFuWjcFuuKkljCExElsecCOAI2OSoBxU/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section><section><section><section><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/dVw6Fiav4ckBpl7GN0nQacWxIiacccs86D9n8Sfe4XeDzQEFia9Euv8eiaKl7pO44AtYXRbEib5jM4huq1sibWxx4EXoDd2ff4PsxGyrC9aibPTPaA/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span><span>对高校学子而言，两会是全国人民政治生活中的一件大事，也是我们了解国家发展的重要窗口。我在新闻上看到广东的代表委员们背着“大湾鸡”文创背包出发，把大湾区“特产”带到全国两会现场，作为十五运会和残特奥会志愿者，我同感自豪。听完政府工作报告后，我更是备受鼓舞，对“十五五”发展充满信心。</span></span></p><p><span><span>作为人工智能与低空技术学院的博士生，我特别期待人工智能技术在新质生产力发展中的广阔空间，尤其是在低空农业、社会保障等领域的落地应用。我将继续深入人工智能、无人机等相关技术研究，助力农田增产、农民增收，为农业农村现代化建设贡献青春力量。</span></span></p></section></section></section><p><span><span>华南农业大学将</span></span></p><p><span><span>认真学习贯彻全国两会精神</span></span></p><p><span><span>以立德树人为根本</span></span></p><p><span><span>以强农兴农为己任</span></span></p><p><span><span>抢抓</span></span><span><span>“十五五”发展机遇</span></span></p><p><span><span>为加快推进农业农村现代化</span></span></p><p><span><span>全面建设社会主义现代化国家</span></span></p><p><span><span>作出更大</span></span><span><span>贡献</span></span></p><section><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/w4bIWyNFlc9JuUicTWpVBjeicaTwSpcuT21d27go9l1I3YiaCJ1ZA6s6IJZLEhKHYtiaVsuTqt8Tvl5E7HD0ALSloQ/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><b><span>往期回顾</span></b></span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><a href=\"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=MjM5OTE2MzUwNA==&amp;mid=2652875726&amp;idx=1&amp;sn=3d9e8f15555b29c646b1a04bafbc6a88&amp;scene=21#wechat_redirect\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><span><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/dVw6Fiav4ckAQnb5Xc2rzYYlAHsq7ozUBSTB28ZibsrpwBHVKHHhc5gP3fibUiazU0lIgsVGqdrXIG8HGdBRerltnPtDibok29RPKCf1jFzx32OY/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;from=appmsg\"/></span></a></section></section><section><section><p><span><strong